{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a small town in Indiana, there resides a small pine grove. Locals ruminate on the eeriness of the forest. Children have gone missing over the years and they think the grove is connected. However, nobody has been able or willing to prove it. Are you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, immersive atmosphere that will transport the player right into the shoes of the protagonist</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, detailed world with plenty for the player to discover and explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An environment that will constantly keep the player on their toes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A masterfully made soundtrack that will further immerse the player into the world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense puzzle-like sequences that require the player to think on their feet</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3161690?t=1772678545","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3161690?t=1772678545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161690/844ae7af303ae09befed3738073f04ffcae74289/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772678545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161690/844ae7af303ae09befed3738073f04ffcae74289/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772678545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The Grove contains a moderate amount of blood and grisly imagery. "},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a small town in Indiana, there resides a small pine grove. L